title: 'Air Defense Simulator'
type: software
abstract: >-
  An open-source, educational air-defense simulator: drag a drone, missile or jet
  onto the map and watch a generic defense battery detect, track, identify,
  evaluate, engage and assess it, with the physics explained in plain language.
